<p style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><strong>Approval Process&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 20px;">Some of our volunteer opportunities require a specific application, a background check, and Safe From Harm Training.</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-size: 16px;">Fill out our <a href="https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/2149300e-0851-40fb-add1-882838baa3c2_Volunteer+Application+for+Children.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Volunteer Application for Working with Children</a> </span></li>
<li><span style="font-size: 16px;">Complete the Background Check (The link will be sent to your email address provided on the application)</span></li>
<li><span style="font-size: 16px;">Participate in Safe from Harm Training (Our Volunteer Coordinator will contact you once all the forms are completed and approved!).</span></li>
</ol>
